ChildVault_recoveryInternals
├── storeRebalanceDepositRecovery
│   ├── when amount is zero
│   │   └── it should revert with BaseVault__ZeroRecoveryAmount
│   └── when recovery state already exists
│       └── it should revert with BaseVault__RecoveryAlreadyPending
├── storeEpochDepositRecovery
│   ├── when amount is zero
│   │   └── it should revert with BaseVault__ZeroRecoveryAmount
│   └── when any epoch recovery state exists
│       └── it should revert with BaseVault__RecoveryAlreadyPending
├── storeEpochWithdrawRecovery
│   ├── when amount is zero
│   │   └── it should revert with BaseVault__ZeroRecoveryAmount
│   └── when any epoch recovery state exists
│       └── it should revert with BaseVault__RecoveryAlreadyPending
└── storeRebalanceWithdrawRecovery
    ├── when strategy chain selector is zero
    │   └── it should revert with ChildVault__InvalidRecoveryStrategy
    └── when recovery state already exists
        └── it should revert with BaseVault__RecoveryAlreadyPending
